  "slug": "load-tender-authorization-form",
  "title": "Load Tender Authorization Form",
  "subtitle": "Load Tender: bounds the decision, conditions, and expiry.",
  "description": "Load Tender Authorization Form binds offered load, carrier capacity, equipment, route, rate, handling requirement, and acceptance to a named transport decision, commercial or operating limit, effective time, and the shipper / broker tender authority's confirmation. The transport planning coordinator records the requested Load Tender action and keeps any variance outside the granted authority.",
  "use_case": "Use Load Tender Authorization Form at origin, destination, route, pickup window, delivery window, and equipment location. Reconcile applicable Load Tender requirements with the load, carrier, rate, claim, equipment, document, or inventory boundary that applies. Capture the shipper / broker tender authority's approval, counteroffer, hold, or decline, then reauthorize any change to offered load, carrier capacity, equipment, route, rate, handling requirement, and acceptance.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
