          "key": "stop_and_route",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Do not proceed without renewed authorization",
          "guidance": "Stop normal processing when carrier, capacity, equipment, commitment, rate, or instruction authorization remains unresolved. Protect offered load, carrier capacity, equipment, route, rate, handling requirement, and acceptance; record the Load Tender notification and obtain renewed authorization from shipper / broker tender authority before continuing."
        },
        {
          "key": "authorization_stops",
