            "Equipment or capacity mismatch",
            "Commitment cannot be met",
            "Rate or instruction changed without authority"
          ],
          "guidance": "Identify the affected offered load, carrier capacity, equipment, route, rate, handling requirement, and acceptance scope, preserve the stated limit, and contact shipper / broker tender authority before continuing."
        },
